Content:
Wow i love this series,im so glad im caught up with the lore,something tells me....Rott isnt done with his scemes....
The lore(in my headcannon);
The village was normal before dan came, or...was it? Rott had an ongoing cult,only Fungo and the villager at the top of the church(now gone) knew about it but also wasn't in the cult. Rott knew that they were acting strange around him ,then dan came and gave Fungo authority over the village which made Rott's cult weaker as Fungo and the guy at the top of the church were good friends and had faith in God,they worked together to keep the village away from Rott and the cultist's evil scemes. Rott hated this so he started to investigate dan's house to find information but...ended up getting stuck in his bath but after dan saved him,he travelled to the nether and convinced the cultists to follow him,he went out to seek for power hidden within the nether to empower his cult and convert every villager but....who knows? But we can currently he at peace knowing dan and fungo still have authority,but when will Rott strike?....
